OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 15 JUN
OL,4,G0630FBreakfast
OL,5,     GTom encounters north Norfolk's
OL,6,     Gwildlife and landscapes through
OL,7,     Gmusic, local voices and the
OL,8,     Gsounds of the natural world. With
OL,9,     Ga live performance by The
OL,10,     GShackleton Trio.
OL,11,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,12,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,13,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,14,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,15,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,16,G1300FClassical Live
OL,17,     GAlina Ibragimova, Christian
OL,18,     GPoltera & Cedric Tiberghien play
OL,19,     GRavel & Debussy Piano Trios live
OL,20,     Gat Wigmore Hall, plus Finnish
OL,21,     Gmusic from the Royal Liverpool
OL,22,     GPhilharmonic Orchestra.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
