OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 15 JUN
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Anonymous
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod begins a week of
OL,6,     Gprogrammes celebrating pieces
OL,7,     Gwhose authorship has been lost,
OL,8,     Gdeliberately obscured, or never
OL,9,     Grecorded in the first place.
OL,10,G1700FIn Tune
OL,11,     GKatie Derham presents live folk
OL,12,     Gmusic from the John McCusker Trio
OL,13,     Gin Edinburgh, and pianist
OL,14,     GBenjamin Grosvenor also performs
OL,15,     Gin the studio, ahead of playing
OL,16,     Gwith Aurora Orchestra.
OL,17,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,18,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,19,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,20,     Gfavourites.
