OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 15 JUN
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GThe BBC Symphony Orchestra,
OL,6,     Gconducted by Sakari Oramo, plays
OL,7,     GBartok's Concerto for Orchestra
OL,8,     Gand Betsy Jolas's Latest. Soloist
OL,9,     GMaria Duenas joins for Korngold's
OL,10,     GViolin Concerto.
OL,11,G2145FBetween the Ears: Miniatures
OL,12,     F(Midsummer Dreaming)
OL,13,     GA journey to the edge of sleep,
OL,14,     Gwhere consciousness loosens its
OL,15,     Ggrip and the ordinary becomes
OL,16,     Gstrange.
OL,17,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,18,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,19,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,20,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,21,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,22,     Geverything in between.
